        {"zh": "我的腿把你刨开", "en": "A leg shovels you aside"},
        {"zh": "我们一起撞到岩柱", "en": "We both hit a pillar"},
        {"zh": "那根柱子裂了", "en": "That pillar has cracked"},
        {"zh": "我转了半个圈", "en": "I turn half around"},
        {"zh": "你退开，我重新瞄准", "en": "You back off and I re-aim"},
        {"zh": "这一下没有影响", "en": "That had no effect"}
      ]
    },
    "mate": {
      "operation": "replace",
      "lines": [
